Repealing the school foundation program
HB0293
reserve account.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Bear, Angelos, Heiner and Smith, S
and Senator(s) Hicks and Smith, D
AN ACT relating to school finance; repealing the school foundation program
reserve account; modifying the distribution of revenues from the account; making
conforming amendments; specifying the disposition of funds credited to and from
the account; requiring reports; and providing for an effective date.
